&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_HxCH_nUeygQ7kNvwHHtCfJ&_nc_oc=AdoGuSAvRxPFbDEPsI1gx0OS6UHznnoWJNNwMiz7b8IaFrI7gHPqZnfLI9OVrWxcHKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF46wze-_YMDtnCL2U7OP0dhySxi55pfYKB7EXc_yY1eQ&oe=6A8D952D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bowling Alley VR", "keywords": ["bowling", "3d", "alley", "ball"], "long_description": "Enter the ultimate bowling alley experience designed for Meta Quest. Enjoy immersive lanes, satisfying physics, and easy controls as you aim, roll, and strike your way to victory. Whether you are a beginner or a pro, this fun VR title delivers exciting 3d bowling gameplay for everyone.\n\nChallenge yourself across multiple environments with different lane styles and atmospheres. Improve your timing and accuracy in a skill-based ball throw game where every shot matters. Perfect for quick sessions or long playtime, it brings classic bowling fun into virtual reality with a fresh arcade twist.\n\n**Features**\n- Realistic 3d bowling mechanics with smooth controls\n- Multiple bowling alley environments to explore\n- Fun mini arcade style gameplay for all ages\n- Competitive and casual modes in one arcade game\n\nJump in anytime for relaxing fun or chase high scores with perfect strikes. If you love bowling, party games, and skill challenges, this VR bowling alley adventure is ready for you.", "short_description": "Step into a fun bowling alley experience built for VR. Enjoy realistic lanes, smooth controls, and exciting 3d bowling action in multiple environments. Master every roll in this addictive ball throw game with easy pick-up gameplay. Play solo or with friends in a colorful mini arcade setting packed with fun. A casual and competitive arcade game for all players."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/photonhorizons/privacy-policy-prismhorizons", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ph